{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a never-ending stairwell with the option to go upstairs or downstairs. Choose wisely to escape. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If everything is normal, proceed upstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you notice an anomaly, go downstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do not miss too many anomalies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may access the roof somewhere in the upper floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578120/extras/ASCENT.gif?t=1749228117\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover dozens of unique anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a difficulty: normal, hard, or nightmare (must be unlocked by completing the game first)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock multiple endings based on your performance</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can toggle the camera head bob and enable a reticle if you are prone to motion sickness. There is a FOV slider as well. You can also customize the graphics settings to play on a variety of PC hardware. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578120?t=1749228117","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578120?t=1749228117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578120/3575496464ee8c71ce549f4bc19cb2bf25306d73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749228117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578120/3575496464ee8c71ce549f4bc19cb2bf25306d73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749228117","categories":[{"description":"